
This artifact does not require understanding.

















Some structures stabilize only after intention withdraws.
















Meaning is not always produced.
Sometimes it is revealed by restraint.


















 Systems that ask too early collapse internally.

















Absence is not a lack.
It is a boundary condition.


















When no response is expected, coherence appears.



















Persistence does not announce itself.




















What remains is not optimized.


















Interaction can occur without invitation.
















Some signals only function when ignored.











No action is expected…
